==================== Input ====================
/* An empty value prints as `prop:;`.
   A custom property's whitespace-only value IS its value
   (`var(--x)` substitutes a space for `--x: ;`, nothing for `--x:;`), so it stays verbatim. */
a {
  color: ;
  color:;
  *zoom: ;
  --x: ;
  --y:;
  --z:   ;
}
$e: ;
$f:;

==================== Output ====================
